    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Distinction between Primary Prevention (e.g., immunization, health education) and Secondary Prevention (e.g., Pap smear, screening tests) is heavily tested.",
        "Exact vaccine dosages, routes of administration, and timing per the National Immunization Schedule are high-yield exam topics.",
        "Launch years and core objectives of prominent Indian National Health Programs are frequently asked in competitive exams."
      ],
